<title>USA: RAC pursuing acquisitions.</title>
<headline>RAC pursuing acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>RAC Financial Group Inc said on Tuesday that it is pursuing further consumer finance company acquisitions, strategic acquisitions of correspondents and new hires.</p>
<p>The company said that it may complete some of these activities near term.</p>
<p>RAC reported first quarter earnings of $0.57 a share, compared to $0.23 a share the previous first quarter, on a fully diluted basis.  </p>
<p>RAC recently acquired branches from National Loans Inc, an originator of consumer loans.</p>
<p>Correspondents are wholesalers that sell loans.</p>
